<Page title="Cookies" description="Orkhon Atlas does not set cookies." path="/cookies/">
  <p>Orkhon Atlas does not set any cookies and does not use similar technologies such as local storage for tracking. Fonts and images are served from this site, so no third party is contacted when you read a page.</p>
  <p>Because there are no non-essential cookies, there is no cookie banner. If that ever changes, we will update this page and ask for your consent before setting any non-essential cookie.</p>
  <p>Sites we link to, including operators' websites, may set their own cookies. Check their cookie policies.</p>
</Page>
